# Next.js & React

## Structure
- Routes: `src/app/(main)/`, `src/app/(auth)/`
- Features: `src/features/<domain>/components/`
- Shared UI: `src/components/ui/` (shadcn)
- Prefer **Server Components**; add `"use client"` only when needed (hooks, events, browser APIs)

## Components
- Functional components; props interface named `{Name}Props`
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for class merging
- Use `next/image` for images; remote images allowed via `next.config.js`
- Page metadata via `generatePageMetadata()` from `@/lib/metadata-helpers`

## Data fetching
- Server: call `src/lib/api/*` directly
- Client: TanStack Query hooks in `src/hooks/queries/` and `src/hooks/mutations/`
- Cart: API cart when authenticated; `useCartStore` for guests

## Styling
- Tailwind + CSS variables in `globals.css` (dark theme, glass utilities)
- Prettier: single quotes, trailing commas — see `.prettierrc.json`
- Fonts: Estedad via `src/lib/fonts.ts` — see `fonts.mdc`

## Architecture
- Server `page.tsx` + client feature components — see `architecture.mdc`
